# papita-proxmox-lab — Repository Map

**Proxmox VE cluster** homelab. On-prem PVE nodes connect over **Tailscale** and LAN; Bash deploy scripts orchestrate node setup and cluster ops; Python tooling is dev-only (Poetry + pre-commit).

## Architecture (high level)

```
Local workstation
  deploy/toolkit.sh ──► deploy/proxmox.sh ──SSH──► PVE nodes (deploy/setup/setup-pve-node.sh)
  deploy/mcp.sh     ──► Cursor MCP servers (proxmox-ve, pfsense, truenas)
```

