## Key workflows

### Toolkit (`deploy/toolkit.sh`)

| Action | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `build` | Build wheels from `libs/` → `dist/` |
| `devsync` | build + pip install wheels |
| `test` | build + pytest with coverage |
| `proxmox` / `deploy_proxmox` | Delegate to `proxmox.sh` |

Required: `-e dev|prod`. Optional: `--env-file`, AWS SSO/MFA flags, `--pre-commit`, `--proxmox-action`.

### Proxmox (`deploy/proxmox.sh`)

| Action | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `setup-node` | SCP `deploy/setup/` to node, run `setup-pve-node.sh` |
| `setup-cluster-ha` | QDevice client on all nodes + TrueNAS NFS + HA group on entry host |
| `get-temp` | Cluster-wide temperature via `sensors -j` (requires step 5) |
| `start-cluster` | WoL peer nodes via `pvenode wakeonlan` |
| `stop-cluster` | Per-node `pvesh stopall` + hypervisor shutdown |
| `cluster-nodes` / `local-node` | Discovery helpers |

Requires `--ip-address`. SSH: ControlMaster multiplexing; password via `PAPITA_SSH_PASSWORD` or keys. Sources `utils.sh` before local prerequisite checks (`jq`, `ssh`, `scp`).

### PVE setup steps (`setup-pve-node.sh`)

Step skip: `_skip_pve_step N` when `START_FROM_STEP > N`. Menu max: `PVE_SETUP_LAST_STEP` (18).

| Step | Topic |
|------|--------|
| 1 | APT/repos, deps, unattended-upgrades, upgrade cron, optional microcode |
| 2 | Hibernate/sleep off (sysctl, sleep.conf, logind) |
| 3 | Wake-on-LAN (ethtool, wol.service, pvenode wakeonlan MAC) |
| 4 | Locales |
| 5 | lm-sensors (`sensors-detect --auto`; enables `get-temp`) |
| 6 | chrony NTP (configurable servers) |
| 7 | `/etc/hosts` cluster peers via `discover_hosts.py` (pre-`pvecm`) |
| 8 | Tailscale install, sysctl, optional cluster.fw rule, optional NAT masq |
| 9 | `tailscale up` + optional post-init sanity check (9.4) |
| 10 | Post-startup systemd (quorum wait, ceph noout unset, main-node WoL) |
| 11 | Pre-shutdown systemd (optional `pvesh stopall`, ceph noout set) |
| 12 | Email (postfix + `pvesh` mailto/mailfrom) |
| 13 | SMART cron (`papita-smart-scan.sh`) |
| 14 | Enable Proxmox cluster firewall (`cluster.fw` enable: 1) |
| 15 | Remove PVE subscription nag |
| 16 | vzdump cron (`papita-vzdump-all.sh`, configurable schedule) |
| 17 | Tailscale TLS cert for UI :8006 (main node only) |
| 18 | QDevice client (`corosync-qdevice`) + softdog watchdog (HA fencing prep) |

**Node-installed helpers (when steps run):** `/usr/local/sbin/papita-{smart-scan,vzdump-all,tailscale-cert-renew}.sh`, `/etc/default/papita-{post-startup,pre-shutdown}`, `/etc/cron.d/papita-*`.

## Configuration files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `pyproject.toml` | Poetry (package-mode=false); black/isort/flake8/mypy/pylint/interrogate settings |
| `.pre-commit-config.yaml` | trailing-ws, yaml/toml, shellcheck, isort, black, flake8, pylint, mypy |
| `.gitignore` | `.env`, `poetry.lock`, drawio backups |

## Conventions for agents

- **Shell:** `set -euo pipefail`; source `deploy/utils.sh` + `deploy/usage.sh` before calling `log`; use `log INFO|WARN|ERROR` (or `log "INFO" "…"` in deploy scripts).
- **Remote deploy path on PVE:** `/root/deploy` (default).
- **Secrets:** never commit `.env`, Tailscale API keys; load via env or `--env-file`.
- **Python:** dev tooling only today; extend `libs/` + `tests/` when adding packages.
- **Docs:** operational runbooks in `docs/TIPSNTRICKS.md`; network diagram in `docs/Diagrams.drawio`.
